WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
How is it

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Are you satisfied with the living environment in the community? Brother Yuan

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
I just spoke too loudly

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
From now on, I will be the night master of the community

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Death is the soul of the community

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Who wants me to go

7
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
You have to step over my corpse first

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,030
This will be your room from now on, Brother Yuan

9
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,030
Who is angry in this room?

10
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,030
Much weaker than other rooms

11
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:19,030
Can I change to this room?

12
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,030
This room is already occupied.

13
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:23,030
But our community pays attention to democracy

14
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,030
If you can convince him to switch rooms with you

15
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,030
I have no opinion

16
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:29,030
I am a dignified 3S level weirdo

17
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:32,030
What I'm best at is using my fists to reason with people.
